WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back and draw both knees in toward the chest.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Open the knees wider than the torso and hold the outer edges of the feet.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Stack the ankles over the knees, shins roughly vertical.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gently draw the knees toward the floor beside the ribs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the tailbone heavy and rock softly side to side if it feels good.
